It runs inside the Bitsocial Node Worker, in the process of pkc-js (GPL-3.0-or-later), and takes from
pkc-js only what pkc-js hands every challenge at run time: the author-identity matcher. It contains no
code of pkc-js or of any other package, and has no dependency.
